<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46500" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωός</span></b>  (without <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ι</span>,
		cf. <i><span class="en">
			<u>Schwyzer</u>
			436.2
		</span></i> (Crimisa, <span class="entity">v/iv B.C.</span>), Cret. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δωός</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>Leg.Gort.</u>
			3.41
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Cypr.
		</span></i> pr. n. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζωϝόθεμις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Schwyzer</u>
					684
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(v B.C.)</span>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῶ</span>)
				<i>alive, living</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.209
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.70
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ . . ζωοῦ οὐδὲ θανόντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					17.115
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωὸν ἑλεῖν τινα</span> to take
			prisoner, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				6.38
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωὸν λαβεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					1.2.5
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωγρέω</span>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωὸν δὲ φθιμένων . . κλέος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eleg.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			. —Also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζώς</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.887
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.445
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.194
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>JRS</u>
				15.145
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				148
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cotiaeum</span>) (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ptol.Ascal.
				</span></i>
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζώς</span> Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				2.53
			</span></i>; on the other cases, ib.<i><span class="en">
				712
			</span></i>); <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζοός</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Archil.
				63
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epich.
				189
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Berl.Sitzb.</u>
				1927.161
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cyrene</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				2.5
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζόος</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Epich.
			</span></i> l.c., Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				2.947
			</span></i>).</div>
